{"id":"640a7b260804a3a0","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-smullyan-partial-truth.md","title":"Arithmetic Truth at Each Fixed Logical Degree","display":"thm-smullyan-partial-truth — Arithmetic Truth at Each Fixed Logical Degree","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-smullyan-partial-truth","aliases":["92-thm-smullyan-partial-truth"],"display":"thm-smullyan-partial-truth — Arithmetic Truth at Each Fixed Logical Degree","source":"第 X 章 p. 114，Some Remarks on Arithmetic Truth, item 1（PDF 131）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-formula-degree]]","[[92-df-smullyan-truth]]","[[92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering]]","[[92-thm-smullyan-syntax-recursiveness]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-smullyan-partial-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-smullyan-partial-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-smullyan-partial-truth — Arithmetic Truth at Each Fixed Logical Degree"},{"key":"source","html":"第 X 章 p. 114，Some Remarks on Arithmetic Truth, item 1（PDF 131）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"267c2162514e6e43\" href=\"?note=267c2162514e6e43\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-formula-degree\">92-df-smullyan-formula-degree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6511106aac2e96b7\" href=\"?note=6511106aac2e96b7\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-truth\">92-df-smullyan-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e05c7a445ae4a4cd\" href=\"?note=e05c7a445ae4a4cd\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering\">92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ba289179148c44b3\" href=\"?note=ba289179148c44b3\" title=\"92-thm-smullyan-syntax-recursiveness\">92-thm-smullyan-syntax-recursiveness</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是固定的外部自然数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_E,\\mathrm{Sent}_A,\\deg_E,\\operatorname{True}_E\">\\(g_E,\\mathrm{Sent}_A,\\deg_E,\\operatorname{True}_E\\)</span> 采用原书编号、无指数句子、逻辑度和标准真值。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Arith}_A^1\">\\(\\operatorname{Arith}_A^1\\)</span> 为原书无指数标准模型表达性；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{E,n},F_{E,n},T_E\">\\(T_{E,n},F_{E,n},T_E\\)</span> 为以下定义的码集合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}partial\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\nT_{E,n}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{g_E(F):F\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_A,\\ \\deg_E(F)\\leq n,\\ \\operatorname{True}_E(F)\\},\\\\\nF_{E,n}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{g_E(F):F\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_A,\\ \\deg_E(F)\\leq n,\\ \\neg\\operatorname{True}_E(F)\\},\\\\\nT_E&amp;\\coloneqq\\{g_E(F):F\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_A,\\ \\operatorname{True}_E(F)\\},\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad&amp;\n\\operatorname{Arith}_A^1(T_{E,n})\\land\\operatorname{Arith}_A^1(F_{E,n}),\\\\\nT_E&amp;=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}T_{E,n}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}partial\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\nT_{E,n}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{g_E(F):F\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_A,\\ \\deg_E(F)\\leq n,\\ \\operatorname{True}_E(F)\\},\\\\\nF_{E,n}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{g_E(F):F\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_A,\\ \\deg_E(F)\\leq n,\\ \\neg\\operatorname{True}_E(F)\\},\\\\\nT_E&amp;\\coloneqq\\{g_E(F):F\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_A,\\ \\operatorname{True}_E(F)\\},\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad&amp;\n\\operatorname{Arith}_A^1(T_{E,n})\\land\\operatorname{Arith}_A^1(F_{E,n}),\\\\\nT_E&amp;=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}T_{E,n}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按原书提示同时构造真、假两类的表达式。度0时先解码闭原子，有限项计算给出两边自然数值，再检查 = 或 ≤ 的真假；非法句子码排除在两类外。继承低度时，否定交换真假，蕴涵真由“前件假或后件真”，蕴涵假由“前件真且后件假”。全称真用全部数码实例的低度真谓词，全称假用一个低度假实例。构造器码与数码实例的图可算术表达，因此每个固定有限度的这一步仍是算术公式。可从所有≤n的层一起建下一层，不假设不同公式度均相同。</p>\n<p>并集等式只使用每个有限句子都有某个有限逻辑度。这里没有得到一个对输入 n 和公式码同时正确的同层算术真谓词；若有这样的统一算术公式，其对 n 存在量化就会表达完整真集，与 Tarski 结论冲突。原书给了上述提示，并把完整细节指向 Boolos–Jeffrey 第19章；该外部章节本轮未读取，本节点未宣称机器形式化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-formula-degree","status":"resolved","id":"267c2162514e6e43","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-formula-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-truth","status":"resolved","id":"6511106aac2e96b7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"e05c7a445ae4a4cd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-smullyan-syntax-recursiveness","status":"resolved","id":"ba289179148c44b3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-syntax-recursiveness]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"g_E,\\mathrm{Sent}_A,\\deg_E,\\operatorname{True}_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Arith}_A^1","display":false},{"tex":"T_{E,n},F_{E,n},T_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}partial\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\nT_{E,n}&\\coloneqq\\{g_E(F):F\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_A,\\ \\deg_E(F)\\leq n,\\ \\operatorname{True}_E(F)\\},\\\\\nF_{E,n}&\\coloneqq\\{g_E(F):F\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_A,\\ \\deg_E(F)\\leq n,\\ \\neg\\operatorname{True}_E(F)\\},\\\\\nT_E&\\coloneqq\\{g_E(F):F\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_A,\\ \\operatorname{True}_E(F)\\},\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad&\n\\operatorname{Arith}_A^1(T_{E,n})\\land\\operatorname{Arith}_A^1(F_{E,n}),\\\\\nT_E&=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}T_{E,n}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2480,"backlinks":[{"id":"275a460122ba5530","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书明确每个固定度数的真/假码集算术可表达，完整真码集不算术可表达，见 [[92-thm-smullyan-partial-truth]]。本定义不预设完整真值在一阶算术中有可用的对象语言谓词。"},{"id":"d782096c679079e3","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书说有效可公理化的真算术子系统必不完备，子系统在这里已有“定理为真”的语义限定。它不表示每个相容算术扩展的定理都真。原书固定逻辑度的真值集另见 [[92-thm-smullyan-partial-truth]]。"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-104","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-formula-degree]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-partial-truth]]记录逐固定逻辑度的真/假谓词；统一完整真谓词仍不可算术表达。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-144","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-partial-truth]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-313","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-partial-truth]]"}],"outgoing":["267c2162514e6e43","6511106aac2e96b7","e05c7a445ae4a4cd","ba289179148c44b3"]}